  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">New housing for Naba Kustha Ashram leprosy village</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will help to repair and rebuild the houses of 40 elderly people in Nabha Kustha Ashram leprosy village in West Bengal. These people have been sadly neglected by the government, and risk having their houses falling down around them. Their houses are currently open to wild animals and they are unsafe while sleeping. We aim to give them dignity, safety and comfort for their last years. They have endured enough pain.</narrative>
  </description>
